<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - General Mills rating cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - General Mills rating cut.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>- Donaldson, Lufkin and Jenrette on Monday cut its rating on General Mills Inc to underperform from market performer, a DLJ source said.</p>
<p>-- The source said the rating was cut due to disappointing cereal sales.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not available for comment.</p>
<p>-- General Mills shares were off one at 62-1/4.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
